      "note": [
        "The response option for Unemployed is worded as follows in the survey: 'Unemployed/labour market policy measure (including study-oriented measures)'.\r\n\nThe statistics cover graduates from HVE programmes that were completed the year before the follow-up year. Only graduates registered in Sweden during the follow-up year are included.",
        "The statistics are subject to uncertainty because not everyone responded to the survey. Therefore, a margin of error is always given. It is a range within which the true value is found with 95 percent certainty"
